<title>BELGIUM: EU raises grain import duties.</title>
<headline>EU raises grain import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union raised import duties for high-quality wheat, rye, barley, maize and sorghum, effective on Tuesday, the European Commission said.  </p>
